# Frontend environment configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and adjust. Only VITE_* values are exposed
# to the browser bundle — never put a secret in a VITE_ variable.
#
# There are no secrets here any more. The old deployment kept the session token
# in an HttpOnly cookie set by the Worker and only needed a public API base URL.
# Now Clerk holds the session and Supabase is called directly from the browser, so
# everything the client needs is public by design. The database's protection is
# row-level security, not key secrecy.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Clerk — sign-in, sessions, password resets, user management
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dashboard → API Keys → Publishable key. Starts with "pk_test_" in development.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase — Postgres, Storage and Edge Functions
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project Settings → API.
#
# The anon key is safe to ship: on its own it grants nothing, because every table
# sits behind RLS and an unauthenticated request resolves to zero rows. The
# service_role key is NOT safe — it bypasses RLS entirely. Never prefix it with
# VITE_.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# School identity
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything the application says about *who owns it* — the sidebar masthead, the
# document title, the sign-in screen and the print letterhead — reads from these,
# with the values below as the built-in defaults. Rebranding for another school
# means editing this block and nothing else; leave a value blank to fall back to
# the default rather than rendering an empty heading.
#
# All purely cosmetic. None of it is security-relevant, and none of it is ever
# trusted as markup.
VITE_SCHOOL_NAME=Christ Church Co-Ed School
VITE_SCHOOL_SHORT_NAME=Christ Church Co-Ed
VITE_SCHOOL_LOCATION=Gram Saliwada, Mandla Road, Jabalpur (M.P.), India
VITE_SCHOOL_AUTHORITY=Board of Education, Church of North India, Jabalpur Diocese
VITE_SCHOOL_PHONE=+91 72250 91111
VITE_SCHOOL_EMAIL=
VITE_SCHOOL_WEBSITE=https://cccssj.in/

# Public-facing origin, used as the Clerk redirect base. Must exactly match the
# Clerk instance's allowed origins, including the scheme.
#   Local:  http://localhost:5173
#   Prod:   https://<user>.github.io
VITE_APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REMOVED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_BASE_URL       — the Cloudflare Worker is gone; calls go to Supabase
# VITE_DEV_API_PROXY      — no local API server to proxy to
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY — was never read by any code in src/